  - solvers: GAMG for p_rgh; smoothSolver for U and T.
  - SIMPLE:
    nNonOrthogonalCorrectors 0;
    residualControl { p_rgh 1e-6; U 1e-6; T 1e-6; }
  - relaxationFactors: p_rgh 0.3; U 0.7; T 0.7.

